## Why This Is Asked
Tests multi-tenant orchestration, real-time streaming inference, private isolation via PrivateLink, and drift-aware canaries across tenants.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Model Registry and Pipelines for per-tenant versioning
- PrivateLink and VPC isolation
- Per-tenant feature gating and rate limiting
- Drift detection using per-tenant feature distributions (Feature Store) and latency metrics
- Canary rollout governance with automatic rollback
- Cost modeling per tenant and region

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo routing and canary logic per tenant
function chooseModelForTenant(tenantId, payload) {
  const meta = loadTenantMeta(tenantId);
  const useCandidate = meta.canaryActive && Math.random() < meta.canaryTraffic;
  const model = useCandidate ? meta.candidateModel : meta.currentModel;
  return model.predict(payload);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test per-tenant isolation in a shared endpoint?
- How would you monitor drift with streaming data?
- How do you escalate or rollback a tenant canary automatically when SLA is breached?
